OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F333A1786796306
OL,3,CGolfer back to work as Morrisons
OL,4,Cdriver after #170,000 win
OL,6,FGolfer Joe Dean has gone back to work
OL,7,Fas a supermarket delivery driver, just
OL,8,Ftwo weeks after winning #170,000 at
OL,9,Fthe Kenya Open.
OL,11,FThe 29-year-old, from Sheffield,
OL,12,Ffinished in second place with a score
OL,13,Fof 67, behind winner Darius van Driel
OL,14,Fin Nairobi.
OL,16,FBut he has returned to work for
OL,17,FMorrisons ` despite pocketing prize
OL,18,Fmoney equivalent to more than five
OL,19,Ftimes the average annual salary of a
OL,20,Fhome delivery driver.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,334,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F333A1786796306
OL,3,CGolfer back to work as Morrisons
OL,4,Cdriver after #170,000 win
OL,6,FDean said his success felt "strange"
OL,7,Fafter "doing a regular job for a bit."
OL,9,FHe said: "The money is ridiculous that
OL,10,FI won. But (I) was just more focused
OL,11,Fon the shot at the time. Just one shot
OL,12,Fat one time, just keep in the moment
OL,13,Fand see what happens."
OL,15,FDean turned professional in 2016 but
OL,16,Ftook on part-time work as a delivery
OL,17,Fdriver for Morrisons when the pandemic
OL,18,Fhit in 2020 and several major events
OL,19,Fwere cancelled.
OL,26,@rD@LpmrD@Npn
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,334,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F333A1786796306
OL,3,CGolfer back to work as Morrisons
OL,4,Cdriver after #170,000 win
OL,6,FHe said: "It was around the time,
OL,7,Fmyself and my fiance were trying to
OL,8,Fget a house.
OL,10,F"Golf was a big struggle at the time
OL,11,Fand there weren't many opportunities
OL,12,Fto play. So it all tied in very well,
OL,13,Fand I'm very glad she pushed me to do
OL,14,Fit."
OL,16,FDean, who is the world number 2,930,
OL,17,Fearned his place on to the DP World
OL,18,FTour by coming through all three
OL,19,Fqualifying stages in November last
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,334,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F333A1786796306
OL,3,CGolfer back to work as Morrisons
OL,4,Cdriver after #170,000 win
OL,6,FDespite his prize pot, he is only
OL,7,Fexpecting his winnings to last until
OL,8,Fnext season.
OL,10,FEach DP World Tour event costs around
OL,11,F#4,000 to enter.
OL,13,F"The money will probably last the rest
OL,14,Fof this season and maybe next season
OL,15,Fand that will be it gone," he said.
OL,17,F"So if you don't take the
OL,18,Fopportunities and you don't play well
OL,19,Fit is a big struggle."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,334,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F333A1786796306
OL,3,CGolfer back to work as Morrisons
OL,4,Cdriver after #170,000 win
OL,6,FBut Dean hasn't decided how long he
OL,7,Fwill need to juggle delivery driving
OL,8,Fin Worksop and golf.
OL,10,FHe said: "(It) could be another month
OL,11,For so before my next start. Emily, my
OL,12,Ffiancee, may kick me back here and
OL,13,Ftell me to get some shifts in rather
OL,14,Fthan sat on the settee."
OL,16,FDean's manager, Peter Jones, said:
OL,17,F"It's only the very, very top golfers
OL,18,Fthat don't need the sponsorship and
OL,19,Funfortunately those are the ones that
OL,20,Fget the sponsorship very easily.
OL,26,@rD@KpmrD@Npn
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
